# Scenario 007 — Climate evidence synthesis (event + scoped Memory + bounded task)
/reset
yes
/enterprise
Pacific Climate Research Institute
Maintain useful, transparent, and uncertainty-aware climate evidence briefings.
q
/function
1
Climate Evidence Synthesis
Frame coastal-risk evidence questions, distinguish supplied facts from uncertainty, and prepare work for scientific review.
skip
/add-human-worker
Lead Scientist
1
skip
/function start "Climate Evidence Synthesis"
@timeout 240
@staff /staff
/memory add "Briefings must distinguish observed evidence, model projections, assumptions, and unresolved uncertainty." --scope "Climate Evidence Synthesis"
/memory
/event publish "Coastal flooding briefing requested" --source "Climate Evidence Synthesis" --enterprise "Pacific Climate Research Institute"
/tasks
@note A running Function may or may not create work from an Event; create the bounded briefing Task explicitly.
/task
1
Frame the evidence questions for a coastal-flooding briefing for a specified New Zealand region: observed versus projected data needed, tide and storm-surge uncertainty, key assumptions, and what must be verified against primary sources. Do not invent figures or claim data access.
1
@note Work type, then go-ahead.
1
1
@wait 20
@cap TASK_ID {(task-[0-9]+)}
/tasks
@wait 8
/approve {{TASK_ID}}
@wait 55
/task inspect {{TASK_ID}}
/events
/health "Climate Evidence Synthesis"
